# Riot Games API Key — Personal key recommended (no expiry).
# A Development key also works but expires every 24h.
# Get yours at https://developer.riotgames.com
# The scheduled ETL workflow (.github/workflows/etl.yml) reads the same
# secret name from GitHub Actions secrets, not from this file.
# `pnpm etl profile-sync` (configured profiles in data/profiles.config.json)
# uses the same key locally and in CI — it never reaches the browser.
RIOT_API_KEY=RGAPI-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
